Music Playlist Management System
Objective
To develop a simple music playlist management system using a Singly Linked List that allows users to add, delete, search, and display songs.
About
A Python-based music playlist system using a Singly Linked List.
Features
Add Song
Delete Song
Search Song
Display Playlist
Technologies
Python
Singly Linked List
How to Run
python music_playlist.py
Working
Each song is stored as a node and connected to the next song.
Song 1 → Song 2 → Song 3 → NULL
Future Scope
Play/Pause songs
Next/Previous song
Multiple playlists
GUI support
